# Raw downloaded corpora under external non-commercial licenses (CC-BY-NC-SA
# for PERSUADE/ELLIPSE, mixed/non-commercial-leaning for DAIGT-v2) — not ours
# to redistribute. See README.md for download instructions + sha256 checksums
# so replicators fetch byte-identical versions.
data/persuade_2.0_human_scores_demo_id_github.csv
data/train_v2_drcat_02.csv
data/ellipse_corpus.csv
