# exact reproducibility without repeat API spend.

# Fitted model artifacts derived from CC-BY-NC-SA training data — licensing
# status of derived model weights is unresolved, so these are excluded rather
# than relicensed. Regenerate via scripts/experiment3_separation.py and
# scripts/analyze_ell_genre_compounding.py (deterministic, seeded) after
# downloading the raw corpora above.
*.joblib

